  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_3442.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Artesa, pedan&iacute;a de Onda, ha celebrado estos d&iacute;as sus Fiestas Promesas, con una emotiva y fr&iacute;a procesi&oacute;n del Sant&iacute;simo Sacramento la noche del domingo (46 fotos), misas lunes por San Roque y martes por difuntos, y una cena de sobaquillo con discom&oacute;vil, organizada por la Comisi&oacute;n la noche del s&aacute;bado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3407.jpg\" alt=\"img_3407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3408.jpg\" alt=\"img_3408\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3409.jpg\" alt=\"img_3409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3410.jpg\" alt=\"img_3410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3412.jpg\" alt=\"img_3412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3413.jpg\" alt=\"img_3413\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3414.jpg\" alt=\"img_3414\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/processofestespromesesartesa14/img_3415.jpg\" alt=\"img_3415\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.de